# Planning notes are kept local: they read as meeting minutes (they quote the
# discussion) rather than as published documentation.  The published manual is
# in manual/, a separate directory on purpose: Git will not descend into an
# ignored one to find an exception for a file inside it.
/docs/

# The language-detection model: 916 KB (lite) or 125 MB (full), and its weights
# are CC BY-SA 3.0 even though fastText's code is MIT.  Downloaded by CI and
# bundled into releases rather than committed.
models/lid.176.*
